[[[[138.48052445496805, 285.3325845732578, "Members’ Attendance in the House of Assembly  "]], [[7.984716805964354e-05, 528.8341419945134, "Section 13 of the House of Assembly Accountability, Integrity and Administration Act requires that a Member "]], [[0.0002794650881909888, 538.3142528089804, "(excluding the Premier, the Leader of the Official Opposition and the Leader of a Third Party) attend the House "]], [[0.0002794650881909888, 463.52076270601674, "of Assembly when it is sitting, but outlines acceptable reasons for a Member’s absence, such as: "]], [[18.000226561106473, 156.5944427552636, "•    sickness of the Member; "]], [[18.00028644648254, 352.43416213534306, "•    adoption, pregnancy or parental leave as established by directive; "]], [[17.99974747809813, 269.4798567286264, "•    a serious illness related to the Member’s family; "]], [[17.99980736347414, 103.55405385775092, "•    bereavement; "]], [[17.99986724885015, 526.5544110548476, "•    attendance at a meeting of a committee of the House of Assembly, the Management Commission or a "]], [[35.99987423024456, 187.43404441539215, "committee of the Commission; "]], [[17.99992713422627, 515.754186431934, "•    attendance to duties as a Member of a caucus, attendance to constituency business, or attendance to "]], [[35.99993411562056, 145.67413520577782, "ministerial duties; and "]], [[17.999987019602273, 272.5141414422294, "•    other circumstances as approved by the Speaker. "]], [[0.0, 534.5941049397604, "By January 31 of each year, a Member is required to file with the Clerk a declaration under oath or affirmation "]], [[0.0, 525.4738641539608, "of his or her attendance while the House of Assembly was sitting in the previous year. Dates of any absences "]], [[0.0, 531.834699931051, "and an explanation for those absences must be provided.  A deduction in the amount of $200 is made from the "]], [[0.0009980896007419915, 518.3952688606694, "Member’s salary for each day the Member was absent from a sitting of the House of Assembly for a reason "]], [[0.0009980896007419915, 228.23510073099456, "other than those provided for in the legislation. "]], [[0.0009980896007419915, 538.7951510229428, "The following table provides a summary of the attendance of all Members of the House of Assembly, including "]], [[0.0009980896007419915, 534.7154048210133, "those who resigned or were elected during the reporting period January 1 to December 31, 2011. The House of "]], [[0.0009980896007419915, 523.1613252745242, "Assembly had 34 sitting days during this period.  The Summary of Members’ Attendance includes Members "]], [[0.0009980896007419915, 491.2747244674148, "who were elected to the 46th General Assembly as well as those elected to the 47th General Assembly. "]], [[46.560546471973936, 496.4353140387726, "Summary of Members’ Attendance for the Period January 1, 2011 - December 31, 2011 "]], [[47.40006088716807, 94.19432593056376, "Member "], [228.24048855096808, 269.75478366368066, "District "], [370.32043171896805, 424.67464963037503, "Approved "], [470.6403915909681, 504.234622876157, "Other "]], [[372.3604309029681, 422.63467522368114, "Absences "], [462.3603949029681, 512.6346102391592, "Absences "]], [[7.984716805964354e-05, 55.07432955350801, "Baker, Jim "], [149.40052008696804, 223.914735940442, "Labrador West "], [393.0004226469681, 401.9946841321844, "3 "], [483.00038664696797, 491.99467742811044, "0 "]], [[7.984716805964354e-05, 64.91434040720065, "Ball, Dwight "], [149.40052008696804, 226.5547440095617, "Humber Valley "], [393.0004226469681, 401.9946841321844, "0 "], [483.00038664696797, 491.99467742811044, "0 "]], [[7.984716805964354e-05, 63.71432741907684, "Bennett, Jim "], [149.40052008696804, 196.91475099149773, "St. Barbe "], [393.0004226469681, 401.9946841321844, "0 "], [483.00038664696797, 491.99467742811044, "0 "]], [[7.984716805964354e-05, 83.51432120121099, "Buckingham, Ed "], [149.40052008696804, 222.44064268924822, "St. John’s East "], [393.00042264696